[
    {
        "content": "<p>If I have the following in scope</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">variable</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">MonoidalAction</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tensorObj</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tensorUnit</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">actionₗ</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">MonoidalAction</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tensorObj</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tensorUnit</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">actionᵣ</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>in scope, is there a way I can avoid mentioning it again in the following?</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ProfOptic</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toExOptic</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">MonoidalAction</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tensorObj</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tensorUnit</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">actionₗ</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">MonoidalAction</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tensorObj</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tensorUnit</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">actionᵣ</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ProfOptic</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tensorObj</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tensorUnit</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">actionₗ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">actionᵣ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">β</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ς</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">τ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">-&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ExOptic</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tensorObj</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tensorUnit</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">actionₗ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">actionᵣ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">β</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ς</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">τ</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">xpo</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">xpo</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⟨</span><span class=\"n\">tensorUnit</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">MonoidalAction</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">unitor_inv</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tensorObj</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">MonoidalAction</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">unitor</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tensorObj</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">⟩</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>Currently the types of <code>actionₗ</code> and <code>actionᵣ</code> in <code>ProfOptic.toExOptic</code> are correctly inferred from their occurence in a <code>variable</code> declaration, but not the subsequent <code>MonoidalAction</code> instances which have to be added manually.</p>",
        "id": 585526559,
        "sender_full_name": "nrs",
        "timestamp": 1776202401
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>can you just not mention it? what does wrong if you don't?</p>",
        "id": 585526841,
        "sender_full_name": "Aaron Liu",
        "timestamp": 1776202558
    },
    {
        "content": "<p><code>ProfOptic</code> requires it in its definition, so the definition of <code>ProfOptic.toExOptic</code> will throw a failed to synthesize <code>MonoidalAction tensorObj tensorUnit actionₗ</code> error.</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ProfOptic</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">tensorObj</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tensorUnit</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">actionₗ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">-&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">-&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">MonoidalAction</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tensorObj</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tensorUnit</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">actionₗ</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">actionᵣ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">-&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">-&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">MonoidalAction</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tensorObj</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tensorUnit</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">actionᵣ</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">β</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ς</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">τ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">P</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">-&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">TambaraModule</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tensorObj</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tensorUnit</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">actionₗ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">actionᵣ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">P</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">-&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">P</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">β</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">-&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">P</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ς</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">τ</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>(full code at <a href=\"https://gist.github.com/nrs-status/8d92fb13c0069174892ba6b733ffbb8c\">https://gist.github.com/nrs-status/8d92fb13c0069174892ba6b733ffbb8c</a>)</p>",
        "id": 585527183,
        "sender_full_name": "nrs",
        "timestamp": 1776202720
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>I reuse the exact same instances across this file but I can't get the instances to get added to the declarations correctly when using <code>variable</code></p>",
        "id": 585527774,
        "sender_full_name": "nrs",
        "timestamp": 1776203000
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>hm i am willing to write a new command to handle this case, if there's no proper way to do it with <code>variable</code>. I thought I could use something like <code>include</code> but that works only for theorems</p>",
        "id": 585532665,
        "sender_full_name": "nrs",
        "timestamp": 1776205653
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>does it with if you write out all the variables instead of relying on autoimplicit</p>",
        "id": 585538561,
        "sender_full_name": "Aaron Liu",
        "timestamp": 1776209337
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>No luck,  </p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">variable</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">tensorObj</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">u</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">-&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">u</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">-&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">u</span><span class=\"o\">}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">tensorUnit</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">u</span><span class=\"o\">}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">actionₗ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">u</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">-&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">-&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"o\">}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">actionᵣ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">u</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">-&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">-&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"o\">}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">axl</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">MonoidalAction</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tensorObj</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tensorUnit</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">actionₗ</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">axr</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">MonoidalAction</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tensorObj</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tensorUnit</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">actionᵣ</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">variable</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">tensorObj</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tensorUnit</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">actionₗ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">actionᵣ</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">in</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ExOptic</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">β</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ς</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">τ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">Σ</span><span class=\"n\">μ</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">ς</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">-&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">actionₗ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">μ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">×</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">actionᵣ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">μ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">β</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">-&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">τ</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>will not add <code>axl</code>, <code>axr</code>, <code>tensorObj</code>, nor <code>tensorUnit</code> to <code>ExOptic</code>, which messes up inference later</p>",
        "id": 585540761,
        "sender_full_name": "nrs",
        "timestamp": 1776211050
    },
    {
