    {
        "content": "<p><span class=\"user-mention silent\" data-user-id=\"749978\">nrs</span> <a href=\"#narrow/channel/113488-general/topic/How.20do.20I.20add.20.60variable.60.20instance.20implicit.20to.20declaration.3F/near/585527183\">said</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>(full code at <a href=\"https://gist.github.com/nrs-status/8d92fb13c0069174892ba6b733ffbb8c\">https://gist.github.com/nrs-status/8d92fb13c0069174892ba6b733ffbb8c</a>)</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Does this version give the error? I don't get an error on 4.29.1 for the definition of <code>ProfOptic.toExOptic</code>.</p>",
        "id": 585617783,
        "sender_full_name": "fiforeach",
        "timestamp": 1776247022
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>That code is written on nightly-03-26 which is also 4.29,  you will get an error if you remove the duplicates for any of the variables declared in this top <code>variable</code> declaration:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">variable</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">tensorObj</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">u</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">-&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">u</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">-&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">u</span><span class=\"o\">}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">tensorUnit</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">u</span><span class=\"o\">}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">actionₗ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">u</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">-&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">-&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"o\">}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">actionᵣ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">u</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">-&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">-&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"o\">}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">axl</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">MonoidalAction</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tensorObj</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tensorUnit</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">actionₗ</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">axr</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">MonoidalAction</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tensorObj</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tensorUnit</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">actionᵣ</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>you can see, these are duplicated in some definitions lower in the file and removing the duplicates cause errors</p>",
